        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "For that, you need to know something about the authority of Standard English, the variety of English you are expected to use when you write formal papers and professional documents. (It has national variants, but for our purposes, it is enough to know that there is a standard that's expected in most academic and professional contexts.)",
            "block_bbox": [
                78,
                117,
                772,
                244
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 1,
            "group_id": 2,
            "global_block_id": 2,
            "global_group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    78.0,
                    117.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    117.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    244.0
                ],
                [
                    78.0,
                    244.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Opinion is split on Standard English's social role. Some see Standard English as just another device to stigmatize the language of marginalized and disenfranchised groups and thereby suppress their social and political aspirations. Others hold that Standard English, as elaborated and refined by generations of writers and grammarians, is the best of all possible Englishes. Both views contain elements of truth.",
            "block_bbox": [
                78,
                247,
                772,
                399
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 3,
            "global_block_id": 3,
            "global_group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    78.0,
                    247.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    247.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    399.0
                ],
                [
                    78.0,
                    399.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Critics of Standard English rightly note that, for centuries, those in power have used grammatical “error” to screen out those unwilling or unable to acquire the habits of the schooled middle class. But these critics are wrong to claim that those rules were devised for that end. Standard forms of a language originate in accidents of geography and economic power. When a language has different regional dialects, that of the most powerful speakers usually comes to be considered the most prestigious and “correct.”",
            "block_bbox": [
                78,
                403,
                772,
                583
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 4,
            "global_block_id": 4,
            "global_group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    78.0,
                    403.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    403.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    583.0
                ],
                [
                    78.0,
                    583.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Thus if Edinburgh rather than London had become the center of Britain's economic, political, and literary life, we would speak and write less like Shakespeare and more like the Scottish poet Robert Burns:",
            "block_bbox": [
                78,
                585,
                772,
                661
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 5,
            "global_block_id": 5,
            "global_group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    78.0,
                    585.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    585.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    661.0
                ],
                [
                    78.0,
                    661.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A ye wha are sae guid yourself All you who are so good yourselves",
            "block_bbox": [
                113,
                673,
                664,
                698
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 6,
            "global_block_id": 6,
            "global_group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    113.0,
                    673.0
                ],
                [
                    664.0,
                    673.0
                ],
                [
                    664.0,
                    698.0
                ],
                [
                    113.0,
                    698.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Sae pious and sae holy, So pious and so holy,",
            "block_bbox": [
                115,
                703,
                557,
                727
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 7,
            "global_block_id": 7,
            "global_group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    115.0,
                    703.0
                ],
                [
                    557.0,
                    703.0
                ],
                [
                    557.0,
                    727.0
                ],
                [
                    115.0,
                    727.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Ye've nought to do but mark You've nothing to do but talk and tell about",
            "block_bbox": [
                114,
                732,
                622,
                786
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 8,
            "global_block_id": 8,
            "global_group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    114.0,
                    732.0
                ],
                [
                    622.0,
                    732.0
                ],
                [
                    622.0,
                    786.0
                ],
                [
                    114.0,
                    786.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Your neebours' faults and folly! Your neighbors' faults and folly!",
            "block_bbox": [
                114,
                793,
                634,
                817
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 9,
            "global_block_id": 9,
            "global_group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    119.0,
                    793.0
                ],
                [
                    633.0,
                    793.0
                ],
                [
                    633.0,
                    816.0
                ],
                [
                    119.0,
                    816.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Conservatives, on the other hand, are right that many rules of Standard English originated in efficient expression and that its use by the best writers over centuries has expanded and honed its resources. But they are wrong to claim on these grounds that Standard English must be socially, intellectually, and even morally superior to other allegedly debased varieties of English.",
            "block_bbox": [
                78,
                831,
                772,
                960
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 10,
            "global_block_id": 10,
            "global_group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    78.0,
                    831.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    831.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    960.0
                ],
                [
                    78.0,
                    960.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Here's the Point",
            "block_bbox": [
                118,
                1015,
                352,
                1045
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 11,
            "global_block_id": 11,
            "global_group_id": 11,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    118.0,
                    1015.0
                ],
                [
                    352.0,
                    1015.0
                ],
                [
                    352.0,
                    1045.0
                ],
                [
                    118.0,
                    1045.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Those determined to discriminate will seize on any difference. And since language seems to directly reflect the quality of our minds, it's easy for those inclined to look down on others to think that grammatical \"errors\" indicate intellectual or moral deficiency. That belief is not just factually wrong; in a democracy, it is also socially destructive. Yet even if both history and logic attest to the once-respectable ain't, so great is the power of social convention that we avoid it, at least in our academic and professional writing.",
            "block_bbox": [
                116,
                1060,
                772,
                1203
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 11,
            "group_id": 12,
            "global_block_id": 12,
            "global_group_id": 12,
            "block_polygon_points": [
